00:03:19.531 --> 00:03:22.910
They directly push you, and
then they feel you push back,

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:25.390
then the hands come back.

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:27.289
Then, because you push to me,

00:03:27.289 --> 00:03:29.490
then I come to fight you.

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:32.390
It's like a crash.

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:35.751
That's why, in the film,
they're doing this one.

00:03:40.496 --> 00:03:42.954
If you have the backflip

00:03:42.954 --> 00:03:44.720
