00:03:53.070 --> 00:03:56.640
You can see they grab
your leg and only lift up.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:00.783
In that time, you could do
backspin and do this kick.

00:04:02.874 --> 00:04:04.410
I think it is possible.

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.401
For the easy way,

00:04:05.401 --> 00:04:07.917
if he grab on my leg and
there's one leg there,

00:04:07.917 --> 00:04:10.806
so, I can punch you in a way where I just

00:04:10.806 --> 00:04:13.690
