I think even, like, eight or nine.

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:31.878
The king of the weapons is a spear.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:34.750
Because the king of weapons, that's why,

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.110
because it very difficult to practice.

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:39.560
Very difficult to make a high achievement.

00:10:39.560 --> 00:10:43.394
The top of the spear,
you know, you go to stab,

00:10:43.394 --> 00:10:45.904
you know, it's like a arrow shooting.

00:10:45.904 --> 00:10:49.540
So, and very fast, very
direct, very powerful.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.890
It's hard to block, very hard to block.

00:10:51.890 --> 00:10:55.340
Especially when they use this technique.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.498
You know, we call it lán ná zhā.

00:10:57.498 --> 00:10:59.656
Lán means block.

00:10:59.656 --> 00:11:01.339
Ná means control.

00:11:01.339 --> 00:11:02.900
Zhā means stab.

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:05.171
When we parry the spear in Shaolin,

00:11:05.171 --> 00:11:08.102
the master teach, only standing
here holding the stick,

00:11:08.102 --> 00:11:10.582
just holding the spear, just
keep doing this movement.

00:11:10.582 --> 00:11:13.793
Pah, pah, pah. Pah,
pah, pah. Pah, pah, pah.

00:11:13.793 --> 00:11:16.150
So, practice that many time.

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:18.758
