00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:30.870
In the film, they show that kind of skill.

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.170
It's not easy to get.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:34.490
The sword, they have
all different technique.

00:11:34.490 --> 00:11:38.260
For example, if you're
holding the sword in here,

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.940
so people use a spear to attack you,

00:11:40.940 --> 00:11:43.680
