then it's being blocked.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:46.920
So once you blocked, then
you can use your sword

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:49.252
to chop him, to attack.

00:11:49.252 --> 00:11:51.188
And also, you have one hand is free.

00:11:51.188 --> 00:11:54.534
If the spear stab me, so I go like that.

00:11:54.534 --> 00:11:55.567
I go like that,

00:11:55.567 --> 00:11:59.361
so then I can use my hand, you see? Grab.

00:11:59.361 --> 00:12:02.169
Yeah. So you're very fast
there. Go, "pah, pah, pow!"

00:12:05.249 --> 00:12:08.290
If you, for example, if you go here,

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:12.460
