have to quickly go down.

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:20.027
That's why the sword,

00:12:20.027 --> 00:12:22.610
they have very important basic movement

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:24.943
we call chán tóu guǒ nǎo.

00:12:24.943 --> 00:12:27.601
Chán tóu guǒ nǎo basically is your head.

00:12:27.601 --> 00:12:29.357
They use, for example, this is the sword,

00:12:29.357 --> 00:12:33.410
I go from here, go to your
head, come back, come up,

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:36.710
