00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:37.543
They have two ways.

00:12:37.543 --> 00:12:39.230
One is like this.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.850
Two is like that, opposite way, come back.

00:12:41.850 --> 00:12:44.520
This is a basic movement
when you learn the sword.

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:47.790
Kung fu is not only fist or legs.

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:49.773
